"role.tanukiNGWord.name" : "Forbidden Word"
"role.tanukiNGWord.short" : "NG"
"role.tanukiNGWord.blurb" : "One word can cost your life."
"role.tanukiNGWord.generalBlurb" : "One word can cost your life."
"role.tanukiNGWord.doc" : "A modifier that kills you when you say your forbidden word.<br>Choose how many players receive words. Use the host's UTF-8 list, or collect a word from everyone at game start.<br>By default, your word appears at the top of the screen. An optional mode hides your word and displays other players' words above their names. During meetings, they appear directly above the name inside each voting plate.<br>After you die, all assigned words, including your own, are shown regardless of this setting."
"role.tanukiNGWord.tips" : "・Use Browse in the host's lobby settings to select a UTF-8 list; the default is TanukiBCL/NGWords.txt. Optional readings use | separators.<br>・Save the template or current list to any location with the save buttons.<br>・Desktop and .NET clients recognise their own microphone. Only Web/mobile participants are recognised by the host.<br>・Meeting detection is configurable. Lists shorter than the player count reuse words.<br>・Recognition uses the Japanese model. Test unusual words before playing."
"options.role.tanukiNGWord.detail" : "Assign forbidden words to a configurable number of players; saying one causes instant death."
"options.role.tanukiNGWord.enabled" : "Assign forbidden words"
"options.role.tanukiNGWord.meetings" : "Recognise forbidden words during meetings"
"options.role.tanukiNGWord.hideOwnWord" : "Hide your word and show it to other players"
"role.tanukiNGWord.hud" : "Forbidden word: "
